# Owner half of the ``__clausal_functor_signatures__`` registry-copy test
# (tests/test_tagged_terms.py, TestFunctorSignatureRegistry). Declares a
# data functor (with fields, so it gets a registry entry) and a bare atom
# (no fields, so it does NOT) for ``-import_from`` on the importer side to
# copy across the module boundary.
-module(sig_registry_owner, [pt(x, y), ao])
pt(1, 2),
